Either it's looking to the right or it's looking to the left.
要么朝右看，要么朝左看。

00:21:15.630 --> 00:21:17.750
And so if I change the rotation style to Left,
所以如果我把旋转样式改成左右旋转，

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:19.640
Right by clicking on this middle button here
只需点击这里中间的这个按钮

